{
  "index": 24,
  "response": "**Nmap** is an open-source suite of security tools for network administrators and security professionals. Nmap allows you to:\n\n* **Scan for vulnerabilities** in your network.\n* **Identify open ports and services** on your network.\n* **Test your network for security weaknesses.**\n* **Discover the version of the operating system** running on your devices.\n* **View network maps and resources** such as DHCP leases and DNS records.\n* **Test for malware and other threats.**\n\nThe main purpose of Nmap is to provide a comprehensive and easy-to-use tool for security professionals to **identify and assess vulnerabilities** in their networks.",
